    "{\n  \"id\": \"kart\",\n  \"name\": \"\346\263\241\346\263\241\345\215\241\344\270\201\350\275\246\",\n  \"versio"
    "n\": \"3.0.0\",\n  \"entry\": \"index.html\",\n  \"description\": \""
    "Lap-running 3D kart on a Mobius strip. The resident mode"
    "l is the only source of obstacles: each one is a /v1/sys"
    "temone decision (a 12-way choice of obstacle kind and la"
    "ne) placed ahead in real time, with the option letters s"
    "huffled, a fresh variation seed and a random pressure po"
    "int so every decision aims to maximise lap difficulty. T"
    "he sidebar shows obstacle statistics, kart statistics an"
    "d the decision variation; every spawn, hit and lap is st"
    "ored in sqlite.\",\n  \"storage\": \"server sqlite via /v1/ap"
    "ps/kart (games + events + state), localStorage:cwick.kar"
    "t.v3 fallback\"\n}\n"
    "\000";

